  "description": "Ali Firas discovered that libheif incorrectly handled certain images. An\nattacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service or\nexecute arbitrary code. (CVE-2026-62291)\n\nDmitrijs Trizna discovered that libheif incorrectly handled certain image\nsequences. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of\nservice. (CVE-2026-62377)",
